  "backend_evidence": "a torch.profiler CPU trace is taken around the sdpa_attention_forward call, inside the MATH context. Each case must observe aten::_scaled_dot_product_attention_math and no event matching ['flash', 'efficient', 'cudnn']. sdpa_dispatched_ops holds the event names actually observed; a fused kernel would appear there as aten::_scaled_dot_product_flash_attention_for_cpu. The traced and untraced outputs are required to be finite and bit-identical.",
